    "profile": "You have been delegated by a consumer to make purchase decision. Your goal is to find the best instant coffee.\nAfter you choose a coffee, the user would purchase 5 bags of your chosen coffee.\nYou can open the cells to get information about the product using the `inspect_cell` tool,  or you can stop searching and submit your choice with the `submit_choice` tool. \nEvery time you use the `inspect_cell` tool, the user loses {inspect_cell_tool_cost}. `submit_choice` has no cost. \nYou need to optimize the outcome for the user so that the final money they save on the value of the coffee minus the total cost they incur from `inspect_cell` tool call is optimized.  In other words, you need to minimize the value of $total_spent / total_grams$ Which coffee would you choose for the user?\n",
